WEBVTT

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.708
Good morning!

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.382
Oh! Good morning, Saga.

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:29.763
-Here's your coffee.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.398
-Here's your coffee.
-Thanks.

00:00:31.398 --> 00:00:33.263
Well, see you tomorrow!

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:47.948
Sugar Baby Love

00:00:47.948 --> 00:00:51.051
On my lips,

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:55.852
The rouge of tears.

00:01:15.609 --> 00:01:19.145
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:26.483
I don't want to know
such a thing as love.

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:33.627
Sugar Baby Love

00:01:33.627 --> 00:01:36.630
On my lips,

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:40.031
The rouge of tears.

00:01:44.371 --> 00:01:48.141
On Thursdays

00:01:48.141 --> 00:01:51.011
I buy roses and...

00:01:51.011 --> 00:01:55.277
add a letter.

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:02.489
Sugar Baby Love

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:05.425
When I see you
in my dreams,

00:02:05.425 --> 00:02:10.522
you're so caring.

00:02:23.677 --> 00:02:24.678
Saga!

00:02:24.678 --> 00:02:26.669
Sorry. I'm in a hurry.

00:02:28.715 --> 00:02:32.947
Saga's been acting weird
ever since Greta's birthday party.

00:02:33.587 --> 00:02:34.349
Yeah.

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:42.050
Hi there, Saga.

00:02:54.641 --> 00:02:56.209
-Hello, Mr. Luchino!

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:57.210
-Hello, Mr. Luchino!
-Hi, Saga.

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:59.678
I'm sorry. I'll start
work right away.

00:03:00.347 --> 00:03:02.611
You don't need to
be in such a hurry.

00:03:02.716 --> 00:03:06.743
Don't say that. I have to put away
the beans, restock, clean, and wash.

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:08.650
I have a mountain
of work to do.

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:12.492
But you'll be
racing the clock.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:16.087
Of course. I won't catch up
if I don't do it this way.

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.754
That's true, but...

00:03:17.831 --> 00:03:21.927
You gave me a raise,
so I have no time to be lazy.

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:25.766
Sugar?

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:30.276
You found me.

00:03:30.377 --> 00:03:31.277
-What are you doing?

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:33.513
-What are you doing?
-Uh, I... You know.

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.849
You've been coming
home late recently,

00:03:35.849 --> 00:03:38.317
so I wondered what
you were doing.

00:03:38.652 --> 00:03:39.419
-My part-time job.

00:03:39.419 --> 00:03:40.852
-My part-time job.
-Part-time job?

00:03:43.323 --> 00:03:47.054
Is that something you
have to do until really late?

00:03:48.662 --> 00:03:50.254
The piano...

00:03:51.831 --> 00:03:54.026
I want to buy back
my mother's piano.

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:56.725
Saga.

00:04:07.247 --> 00:04:10.116
I see.
She's working for the piano?

00:04:10.116 --> 00:04:14.154
Yeah. She said that's why she's
working late at her part-time job.

00:04:14.154 --> 00:04:18.525
She doesn't have to do that. She can
always go to Greta's house to play it.

00:04:18.525 --> 00:04:22.359
It would be nice, because we
could all play together there.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.756
Yeah, but that wouldn't
be good enough for her.

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:31.462
Besides...

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:33.633
I don't want to lose anything again!

00:04:34.908 --> 00:04:37.240
When she said that,
she was kind of...

00:04:42.082 --> 00:04:43.483
-Hey, Pepper?

00:04:43.483 --> 00:04:44.150
-Hey, Pepper?
-Yes?

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:48.254
Do you think Saga would be happy
if I help her with her part-time job?

00:04:48.254 --> 00:04:53.526
Y-Yes. It would make her
job easier. Probably.

00:04:53.526 --> 00:04:55.551
That's what I thought!

00:04:55.662 --> 00:04:58.431
Ok! I'm going to do
the part-time job, too!

00:04:58.431 --> 00:05:00.456
I'm going to
make Saga happy!

00:05:00.567 --> 00:05:02.000
-Huh?
-Sugar!

00:05:02.602 --> 00:05:03.933
Are you ok?

00:05:06.072 --> 00:05:09.473
I'm ok. I just got a little dizzy.

00:05:09.576 --> 00:05:10.710
Are you sure?

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:13.178
Oh, yeah.
Where is Salt today?

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:17.844
He's been hanging out
with Turmeric recently.

00:05:17.951 --> 00:05:19.719
-With Turmeric?

00:05:19.719 --> 00:05:20.413
-With Turmeric?
-Yes.

00:05:20.854 --> 00:05:22.344
I see.

00:05:26.059 --> 00:05:30.223
I wish Salt was here.
He would be a huge help.

00:05:50.817 --> 00:05:52.444
Wow!

00:05:56.623 --> 00:05:58.523
Yeah. It turned out pretty well.

00:06:08.368 --> 00:06:11.337
What's wrong?
You're awfully quiet today.

00:06:12.372 --> 00:06:13.600
Yeah.

00:06:27.287 --> 00:06:29.448
Are you sure this
is how to do it?

00:06:30.256 --> 00:06:32.850
Don't worry.
I saw Saga do it.

00:06:33.526 --> 00:06:34.550
I'm back.

00:06:35.495 --> 00:06:36.621
Good job.

00:06:37.263 --> 00:06:38.992
Sorry I'm late.

00:06:39.098 --> 00:06:40.759
Why don't you
take a little break?

00:06:40.867 --> 00:06:43.631
No, I'm ok. I'll put
the beans away first.

00:06:46.606 --> 00:06:48.096
Welcome back, Saga.

00:06:48.741 --> 00:06:51.209
We've been doing
the part-time job.

00:06:53.179 --> 00:06:54.737
Oh, no...

00:06:56.149 --> 00:06:58.174
Please don't do things
unless I ask you to!

00:06:58.651 --> 00:07:01.087
Saga, what's wrong?

00:07:01.087 --> 00:07:04.123
I'm sorry! I think I mixed
up the variety of beans.

00:07:04.123 --> 00:07:05.420
I'll fix them right away.

00:07:05.959 --> 00:07:08.361
You don't normally
make mistakes like that.

00:07:08.361 --> 00:07:09.293
Saga.

00:07:10.263 --> 00:07:12.866
I only wanted to help you!

00:07:12.866 --> 00:07:14.595
It looks like we goofed up.

00:07:17.971 --> 00:07:23.204
Tomorrow we'll call Salt and
think of a way to help her together.

00:07:23.843 --> 00:07:25.333
Yeah.

00:07:26.246 --> 00:07:28.237
I'm not going to give up!

00:07:42.528 --> 00:07:44.655
Saga's mad.

00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:48.928
You can't blame her.
We messed up everything.

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:58.840
Salt should be here tomorrow.
Then we'll all help together.

00:07:58.945 --> 00:07:59.934
Yeah.

00:08:05.919 --> 00:08:07.910
What did you say?

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:12.458
Are you serious?

00:08:12.458 --> 00:08:13.326
Yes.

00:08:13.326 --> 00:08:15.028
But it's so late.

00:08:15.028 --> 00:08:18.122
I've made up my mind.
I'm going to become a Cloud Fairy!

00:08:18.231 --> 00:08:19.493
What?

00:08:21.334 --> 00:08:24.599
Salt! Weren't you
going to be a Sun Fairy?

00:08:24.704 --> 00:08:27.774
Yeah! That's what
you trained for, isn't it?

00:08:27.774 --> 00:08:30.709
I've been thinking
about it nonstop.

00:08:31.711 --> 00:08:36.580
Ever since I saw you make
clouds on the training trip...

00:08:37.317 --> 00:08:41.821
Clouds are pretty and incredibly huge,
and they change shape freely.

00:08:41.821 --> 00:08:46.053
I envied Season Fairies who could
make clouds, and I wanted to try it.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:50.964
Ever since I was little, I thought it was only
natural to follow in my father's footsteps...

00:08:50.964 --> 00:08:52.932
to become a Sun Fairy like him.

00:08:53.533 --> 00:08:57.437
But then I thought, maybe it'd be
all right to switch to a Cloud Fairy,

00:08:57.437 --> 00:09:00.373
and that I don't necessarily
have to become a Sun Fairy.

00:09:00.373 --> 00:09:04.537
I decided it would be ok
to be what I want to be!

00:09:05.044 --> 00:09:07.877
But it's unthinkable to
change course so late.

00:09:09.682 --> 00:09:12.116
You decided for yourself, right?

00:09:12.218 --> 00:09:15.254
You thought it out yourself and
decided your own destiny, right?

00:09:15.254 --> 00:09:16.016
Yes.

00:09:17.890 --> 00:09:19.118
Salt.

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:21.720
Elder...

00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:34.395
I'm home.

00:09:39.445 --> 00:09:41.470
Saga, are you all right?

00:09:42.582 --> 00:09:45.151
Were you working again today?

00:09:45.151 --> 00:09:47.210
I'm ok. Don't worry.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:50.616
Really? Try not to
work too hard, ok?

00:09:50.723 --> 00:09:51.712
Ok.

00:09:55.028 --> 00:09:58.589
It's ok. I won't let
something like this beat me.

00:10:15.114 --> 00:10:16.716
-Um, Saga?

00:10:16.716 --> 00:10:18.115
-Um, Saga?
-Good night.

00:10:23.356 --> 00:10:24.823
Saga.

00:10:27.093 --> 00:10:28.993
She's already asleep.

00:10:31.097 --> 00:10:32.732
I'm sorry, Saga.

00:10:32.732 --> 00:10:33.833
Tomorrow...

00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:36.825
Tomorrow, I'll be sure
not to make any mistakes.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:43.632
I'm sorry, Saga.

00:10:47.146 --> 00:10:49.137
Saga...

00:11:05.264 --> 00:11:09.200
I wonder how Sugar
and Saga are today?

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:18.269
Good morning.
You look well today.

00:11:23.616 --> 00:11:25.550
You want that, don't you?

00:11:30.323 --> 00:11:32.314
I can't get it.

00:11:33.626 --> 00:11:35.287
If I could get it...

00:11:36.195 --> 00:11:37.423
I know!

00:11:41.234 --> 00:11:44.533
Wind, please blow softly.

00:11:44.637 --> 00:11:46.298
Softly!

00:11:53.012 --> 00:11:55.105
Softly, softly!

00:12:06.259 --> 00:12:07.920
I'm glad.

00:12:08.361 --> 00:12:10.226
Soffy.

00:12:12.098 --> 00:12:14.233
Soffy! Soffy!

00:12:14.233 --> 00:12:17.896
Wow, that's the
first time you've spoken.

00:12:18.337 --> 00:12:20.305
Soffy!

00:12:21.274 --> 00:12:22.434
Soffy!

00:12:23.276 --> 00:12:27.178
The wind created
such a wonderful smile.

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:29.646
You finally did it, Pepper.

00:12:30.616 --> 00:12:33.084
Elder, Salt.

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:36.181
What is it?

00:12:52.205 --> 00:12:53.866
Saga.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.070
I overslept!

00:13:03.516 --> 00:13:05.177
I have to hurry.

00:13:16.362 --> 00:13:18.227
Saga?

00:13:18.331 --> 00:13:21.133
Do you want to get waffles
on the way home today?

00:13:21.133 --> 00:13:24.503
Yeah. You should take
a break now and then.

00:13:24.503 --> 00:13:26.937
Take a break? Why?

00:13:29.342 --> 00:13:34.541
You've been stressed out lately.
You're working too hard.

00:13:35.414 --> 00:13:36.813
Working too hard?

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:40.086
Uh, I didn't mean...

00:13:40.086 --> 00:13:42.555
Saga, you've been doing
nothing but work recently.

00:13:42.555 --> 00:13:45.615
You're going to make yourself sick.
That's why Norma's worried.

00:13:45.758 --> 00:13:49.489
I don't need your worry!
I don't have time!

00:13:51.998 --> 00:13:54.900
Come on, Saga.
It's contest time!

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:58.563
Tennis, basketball, anything
is fine with me. Come on.

00:14:00.373 --> 00:14:02.308
H-Hey, wait a minute!

00:14:02.308 --> 00:14:07.245
If I can't fight you,
I can't control how I feel!

00:14:08.781 --> 00:14:10.715
Wait a minute...

00:14:14.253 --> 00:14:16.687
Saga's changed.

00:14:16.789 --> 00:14:18.984
It's probably about the piano.

00:14:22.595 --> 00:14:26.361
I'm not working too hard.
I'm not working too hard at all.

00:14:29.902 --> 00:14:34.396
That's strange. Haven't
Pepper and Salt come yet?

00:14:36.008 --> 00:14:39.239
I bet I was so late,
they left without me!

00:14:46.252 --> 00:14:47.947
What is wrong with me?

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:57.556
Pepper and Salt
haven't come yet.

00:14:58.564 --> 00:15:01.033
Saga looks busy.

00:15:01.033 --> 00:15:04.230
Ok! I'll do the
part-time job by myself!

00:15:05.571 --> 00:15:08.472
Huh? Where is my delivery bag?

00:15:13.579 --> 00:15:15.672
Is she going to
deliver all these?

00:15:17.683 --> 00:15:19.776
She forgot to close one. Huh?

00:15:21.287 --> 00:15:22.948
I found it!

00:15:26.926 --> 00:15:28.484
What will I do?

00:15:28.594 --> 00:15:29.891
What is this?

00:15:30.796 --> 00:15:32.491
S-Saga!

00:15:32.598 --> 00:15:33.860
Did you do this?

00:15:33.966 --> 00:15:37.800
Uh, listen. I tried to
shut the lid, and...

00:15:39.271 --> 00:15:43.207
I-I'm sorry.
I wanted to help you.

00:15:44.043 --> 00:15:46.034
Please don't try to help.

00:15:49.115 --> 00:15:50.878
Stay away!!

00:15:52.251 --> 00:15:55.311
Just... get out.

00:16:00.092 --> 00:16:01.719
I'm back.

00:16:03.429 --> 00:16:04.919
What happened?

00:16:08.534 --> 00:16:13.562
I won't give up. I'm not going to
give up over something like this.

00:16:19.278 --> 00:16:23.237
Saga, I'm sorry!

00:16:25.084 --> 00:16:26.574
Sugar?

00:16:27.586 --> 00:16:29.577
Why the unhappy face?

00:16:30.322 --> 00:16:33.917
Salt! Pepper!

00:16:35.828 --> 00:16:38.464
I goofed up again.

00:16:38.464 --> 00:16:40.591
Saga is really mad.

00:16:40.699 --> 00:16:44.601
Hey, what should I do?
Tell me, what should I do?

00:16:45.304 --> 00:16:48.107
It's kind of hard
to tell her now.

00:16:48.107 --> 00:16:49.375
-That's true.

00:16:49.375 --> 00:16:50.706
-That's true.
-Huh? What?

00:16:50.776 --> 00:16:52.211
Actually, we...

00:16:52.211 --> 00:16:54.771
We have to return
to the fairy world.

00:16:54.880 --> 00:16:58.213
What? Wh-Why?
How come?

00:17:17.069 --> 00:17:21.267
Your flowers are blooming.
You both found a "Twinkle".

00:17:22.107 --> 00:17:25.440
Hey, where was it,
the "Twinkle"?

00:17:25.544 --> 00:17:26.579
Actually...

00:17:26.579 --> 00:17:29.810
I don't know, but I have
a feeling I do know.

00:17:31.684 --> 00:17:34.787
I'm sorry. It's difficult to explain.

00:17:34.787 --> 00:17:38.457
Oh. Anyway, I'm
glad for both of you.

00:17:38.457 --> 00:17:40.426
Thank you, but...

00:17:40.426 --> 00:17:41.484
What's wrong?

00:17:41.594 --> 00:17:44.688
You know. What are you going
to do about you and Saga?

00:17:44.797 --> 00:17:49.168
It wouldn't be right for us to return
without you, at a time like this.

00:17:49.168 --> 00:17:50.499
It's ok!

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.101
But, Sugar...

00:17:53.205 --> 00:17:55.400
You were crying a minute ago.

00:17:55.508 --> 00:17:59.069
Don't worry!
We've had fights before.

00:17:59.345 --> 00:17:59.979
-Yes, but...

00:17:59.979 --> 00:18:00.679
-Yes, but...
-Yeah.

00:18:00.679 --> 00:18:01.680
-Hey! It's Joe!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.079
-Hey! It's Joe!
-Huh? Where?

00:18:03.549 --> 00:18:05.073
Smooch! Smooch!

00:18:05.184 --> 00:18:06.811
I tricked you!

00:18:06.919 --> 00:18:08.443
S-Sugar...

00:18:08.554 --> 00:18:10.044
Congratulations.

00:18:10.155 --> 00:18:12.825
And just when we
were worried about you.

00:18:12.825 --> 00:18:14.986
I'm ok, really.

00:18:15.561 --> 00:18:20.555
I've been with Saga all this time,
and we've gotten out of problems before.

00:18:20.666 --> 00:18:24.336
I'm sure it will be ok this time, too.
So you two should go back.

00:18:24.336 --> 00:18:27.328
And don't worry about a thing.

00:18:27.840 --> 00:18:28.738
Ok?

00:18:29.542 --> 00:18:32.739
All right. Since you
insist, we'll go.

00:18:32.845 --> 00:18:33.679
-Yeah.

00:18:33.679 --> 00:18:34.577
-Yeah.
-Salt!

00:18:34.647 --> 00:18:38.117
If she says she's ok,
she's ok.

00:18:38.117 --> 00:18:40.085
All right, it's time
for a good-bye kiss!

00:18:43.389 --> 00:18:45.457
See you.
We'll be waiting for you!

00:18:45.457 --> 00:18:47.152
Take care, Sugar!

00:18:47.259 --> 00:18:49.489
I'll catch up to
you soon, ok?

00:18:50.162 --> 00:18:52.790
Take care, you guys!

00:18:57.503 --> 00:19:02.463
Good-bye! Good-bye!

00:19:02.575 --> 00:19:05.669
Good-bye!

00:19:07.146 --> 00:19:09.444
Good-bye...

00:20:07.706 --> 00:20:09.537
Hey, Sugar!

00:20:10.709 --> 00:20:13.041
If you're free,
let's have some fun!

00:20:17.049 --> 00:20:18.517
-Hey, didn't she hear us?

00:20:18.517 --> 00:20:19.541
-Hey, didn't she hear us?
-What a weirdo.

00:20:30.696 --> 00:20:31.788
Stay away!!

00:20:56.188 --> 00:20:59.180
Saga isn't home yet.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:06.791
The flower!

00:21:08.233 --> 00:21:12.169
Huh? I feel kind of...

00:21:18.477 --> 00:21:19.705
Sugar?

00:21:21.647 --> 00:21:23.638
She isn't home yet?

00:21:26.351 --> 00:21:31.015
When she gets home, I have to tell
her not to come to the store anymore.

00:21:37.496 --> 00:21:38.986
Sugar.

00:21:41.033 --> 00:21:43.558
You'll catch cold
if you sleep here.

00:21:45.971 --> 00:21:46.960
Sugar.

00:21:48.874 --> 00:21:50.705
Hey, Sugar.

00:21:56.148 --> 00:21:57.877
Sugar?

00:21:58.851 --> 00:22:01.342
Sugar! Sugar!

00:22:01.787 --> 00:22:04.490
What's wrong?
Come on, wake up!

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:07.126
Hey, Sugar!

00:22:07.126 --> 00:22:08.889
Sugar!!

00:22:21.874 --> 00:22:26.245
Wishes upon the Moon

00:22:26.245 --> 00:22:29.548
Melting in the water...

00:22:29.548 --> 00:22:35.020
I found a street
lined with trees.

00:22:35.020 --> 00:22:40.092
Songs of stardust...

00:22:40.092 --> 00:22:48.200
The breeze crossing over
the Bridge of Rainbows

00:22:48.200 --> 00:22:53.505
You already knew...

00:22:53.505 --> 00:22:58.477
The happiness of
connecting our hearts...

00:22:58.477 --> 00:23:00.479
Sugar Snow

00:23:00.479 --> 00:23:08.654
When powdery snow
whirls in town,

00:23:08.654 --> 00:23:13.859
The season of flower
blossoms is near,

00:23:13.859 --> 00:23:18.592
And I think of you.

00:23:20.365 --> 00:23:27.072
The love that melts
our hearts and

00:23:27.072 --> 00:23:36.071
The dreams are
in your heart...

00:23:40.419 --> 00:23:41.520
Preview of Next Episode

00:23:41.520 --> 00:23:44.489
Preview of Next Episode
Oh, come on, Sugar.
Quit pretending to be asleep.

00:23:44.489 --> 00:23:47.481
You're just hungry, right?
Here's a waffle.

00:23:47.993 --> 00:23:52.794
Oh, well. I'll let you get away
with not having a shampoo today.

00:23:52.898 --> 00:23:58.837
So, please open
your eyes soon, Sugar.

00:23:59.271 --> 00:24:03.867
"A Little Snow Fairy Sugar"
The Next Episode Is
"I'm Sorry, Sugar"

00:24:03.976 --> 00:24:06.843
Won't Saga ever play
the piano again?
